5° Latitude Zonal Mean, 200 m Vertical for Bending Angle and Refractivity

5° Latitude, 10° Longitude for tropopause parameters


Variables included:



Dry Temperature, (Temp), 10 – 40 km

Bending Angle, (Bend_ang), 0 – 60 km

Refractivity, (Ref), 0 – 60 km

Tropopause Parameters



Cold Point Temperature (cpt)  (for latitudes 30 N - 30 S), Calculated Using Profiles




Data Timeframe: March 2002 – September 2025</gco:CharacterString>
